message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "lunar-ir-data-tools: readers and corrections for Kaguya SP, Kaguya MI and Chandrayaan-2 IIRS data"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/euchas/lunar-ir-data-tools"
url: "https://github.com/euchas/lunar-ir-data-tools"
authors:
  - family-names: Valantinas
    given-names: Adomas
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9995-3335"
    affiliation: "University of Cambridge"
keywords:
  - Moon
  - Kaguya
  - SELENE
  - Spectral Profiler
  - Multiband Imager
  - Chandrayaan-2
  - IIRS
  - reflectance
  - thermal correction
abstract: >-
  Python readers and correction routines for lunar infrared spectrometer data:
  the Kaguya/SELENE Spectral Profiler Level 2C point spectra (PDS3), a footprint
  search through the JAXA DARTS PDAP service, a sampler for Kaguya Multiband
  Imager mosaics, and a Chandrayaan-2 IIRS PDS4 reader with single- and
  two-temperature thermal-emission removal for radiance-to-reflectance
  conversion.
